  "story_text_1": "In 2005, Mirayi Animation Studio embarked on a new frontier in the animation world. Our vision is to be a world's renowned creative content creator, who inspires and bring joy to people. Now, we serve as one of the leading content animation studios in Malaysia.",
  "rebate_text": "Financial benefits associated with co-producing projects with Mirayi include access to Government funding from MDEC and FINAS. Our clients can avail additional financial incentive for the production of creative content within Malaysia through Film in Malaysia Incentive (FIMI), a 30% cash rebate on service projects sourced to Mirayi.",
  "story_text_2": "Being a pioneer in the Malaysian Animation industry, Mirayi also plays a significant role as a point of contact for international producers and animation companies seeking information on co-production and work-for-hire options in Malaysia.\n\nMirayi Animation Studio has been awarded MSC Malaysia status and is fully licensed by the National Film Development Corporation of Malaysia (FINAS).",
  "story_heading_1": "Humble beginnings",
  "story_heading_2": "Animation maker and more",
  "contact_intro": "For Business/Collaboration proposal, please fill in the following form.",
